{# Fixed source queries for Scenario_029 #}

### Query 1
**Description:** Check if the whole pattern ends within 700 time units
**Original formula:**
Pr[<=700] (<> Pattern.end)

### Query 2
**Description:** Check if human enters an invalid position
**Original formula:**
Pr[<=700] (<> !isValidPosition(humanPositionX[0], humanPositionY[0]))

### Query 3
**Description:** Check if robot enters an invalid position
**Original formula:**
Pr[<=700] (<> !isValidPosition(robPositionX[0], robPositionY[0]))
